tlas/wisconsin/shawano-county"],["ARC or PLC in Shawano County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/shawano-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 44% of normal in October to November and 54% in September to October. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1976, with grid 29865 at 60%. A preliminary estimate puts July to August 2026 at 56.9 on grid 30164.</p>"}
